 description is formatted as a docstring fragment rather than a full prose explanation spanning multiple substantive sentences."}, "examples": {"score": 1, "reasoning": "No illustrative examples of correct and effective usage or sample invocations are provided."}}, "error_detail": null, "source_code_sha256": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 952, "output_tokens": 304, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0}, "latency_ms": 1819.185874890536, "evaluated_at": "2026-09-09T22:17:59.934566+00:00"}
