{"schema_version": "1.0", "prompt_version": "v2", "tool_uid": "Accenture/mcp-bench::phq9_score::mcp_servers/medcalc/medcalc/calculator.py:2253", "repo": {"name_with_owner": "Accenture/mcp-bench", "stargazer_count": 502, "primary_language": "Python"}, "tool": {"name": "phq9_score", "qualified_name": "phq9_score", "description": "PHQ-9 (Patient Health Questionnaire-9)\n    Objectifies degree of depression severity.\n    \n    Parameters:\n    -----------\n    interest : int\n        Little interest or pleasure in doing things\n        (0: Not at all, 1: Several days, 2: More than half the days, 3: Nearly every day)\n    feeling_down : int\n        Feeling down, depressed, or hopeless\n        (0: Not at all, 1: Several days, 2: More than half the days, 3: Nearly every day)\n    sleep : int\n        Trouble falling or staying asleep, or sleeping too much\n        (0: Not at all, 1: Several days, 2: More than half the days, 3: Nearly every day)\n    tired : int\n        Feeling tired or having little energy\n        (0: Not at all, 1: Several days, 2: More than half the days, 3: Nearly every day)\n    appetite : int\n        Poor appetite or overeating\n        (0: Not at all, 1: Several days, 2: More than half the days, 3: Nearly every day)\n    feeling_bad : int\n        Feeling bad about yourself or that you are a failure or have let yourself or family down\n        (0: Not at all, 1: Several days, 2: More than half the days, 3: Nearly every day)\n    concentration : int\n        Trouble concentrating on things, such as reading the newspaper or watching television\n        (0: Not at all, 1: Several days, 2: More than half the days, 3: Nearly every day)\n    movement : int\n        Moving or speaking so slowly that other people could have noticed, or being fidgety or restless\n        (0: Not at all, 1: Several days, 2: More than half the days, 3: Nearly every day)\n    self_harm : int\n        Thoughts that you would be better off dead, or thoughts of hurting yourself\n        (0: Not at all, 1: Several days, 2: More than half the days, 3: Nearly every day)\n    \n    Returns:\n    --------\n    int\n        Total PHQ-9 score (0-27)"}, "scenario": "description_only", "judge": {"id": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite", "provider": "google", "model_id": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite", "raw_model_version": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite"}, "status": "ok", "scores": {"purpose": {"score": 5, "reasoning": "The description clearly states that the tool objectifies the degree of depression severity using the PHQ-9 (Patient Health Questionnaire-9) instrument."}, "guidelines": {"score": 2, "reasoning": "The description explains what parameters represent and their valid value ranges, but lacks explicit operational instructions or activation criteria on when to invoke the tool."}, "limitations": {"score": 1, "reasoning": "There is no mention of constraints, potential failure modes, or invalid input handling (such as out-of-range integer values)."}, "parameter_explanation": {"score": 5, "reasoning": "Every input parameter is thoroughly detailed with its clinical meaning and the exact integer scale mapping (0 to 3) corresponding to frequency of symptoms."}, "length_completeness": {"score": 4, "reasoning": "The description is detailed and spans multiple lines covering all parameters and return types, though it lacks usage guidelines and limitations sections."}, "examples": {"score": 1, "reasoning": "No illustrative examples of usage or expected score outputs are provided."}}, "error_detail": null, "source_code_sha256": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 1316, "output_tokens": 300, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0}, "latency_ms": 1658.4473750554025, "evaluated_at": "2026-09-09T22:18:09.777294+00:00"}
